'''Gauntlet of Servants''' (サーヴァント強襲！, ''Sāvanto Kyōshū'', '''Servant Assault!''') is a [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 12.1 Update]]. This [[Gauntlet]] features many enemies from the collab.

==Overview==
===About===
Gauntlet of Servants contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Grail War: Days'''. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Grail War: Day can include XP, [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Ototo Corps|Materials]], [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]] and Catamins. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Gauntlet of Servants/Grail War: Day 1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Gauntlet of Servants is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

